{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1cb854332a5a1f76330a874013fb7c349baa10edbffd2daf7adce3ca92039d6", "ja": "（今日はドラマ撮影のリハーサル。主演のひなたは、\n幼馴染の海賊と対決する提督役だが……）", "zh": "（今天是电视剧拍摄的彩排。主演日向饰演的是\n与青梅竹马的海盗对决的提督，但……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "75351e1aa85215a4e8d13c459d39b62c16274005ee0cebf187129bec16fe10d7", "ja": "はあ……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0164ad9e351535c8d1d194fc33ea3cd249c2ceca6f5e04c3b5e429b57223f1de", "ja": "ひなた？　お疲れさま。\nどうしたんだ？　ため息なんてついて。", "zh": "日向？辛苦了。\n怎么了？怎么突然叹起气来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "70db436ba735fde993b54cbe7797ff945c8e382bc7f9babbe0752b8c18552f35", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……あたし、\nなんだか胸がいっぱいになってしまってねぇ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……我，\n不知怎么的，心里满满的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "8dfcb4e616ee529eeefaddb2377cb73b509e3a79dee92710da2650f4ac4b0abe", "ja": "昔は仲良しだった友達と、\n戦わねばならないなんて、切ないべさ……。", "zh": "曾经关系要好的朋友，如今却必须与她战斗，真让人难过啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7e6adf0a1ac88b16b68a9fa3e674d0af04ad9354bdc5a6967978718b8444f5e7", "ja": "確かに切ない話だよな……大切な友達と、\n別々の道を行かなきゃいけないっていうのは。", "zh": "确实是个令人心酸的事……和重要的朋友，\n不得不各走各的路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "b5a71b6b81eb5ba935f303e1c2d8a4db1b37de504b4181bcdee2564726e82aed", "ja": "どっちが悪いっていう話でもないのにねぇ。\nなんだか悲しいよぉ。", "zh": "明明谁都没有错，却还是让人觉得难过呢。\n总觉得好悲伤啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ad31c1f8b52241d3757343579c510ddccde2697d3274ea219ab058d264c50d95", "ja": "そうだな……でもひなたは、その悲しさを\nしっかりと表現できていたと思うぞ。", "zh": "是啊……不过我觉得，日向已经把那份悲伤很好地表现出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "67fad20268b859a89300589aac05003016e9b4b48ab1c4fe20fe330e92a4d20d", "ja": "本当かい？　泣いちゃダメって監督さんに\n言われてたから、我慢してたんだけども……。", "zh": "真的吗？因为导演说不能哭，所以我一直忍着来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1009_p", "source_sha256": "17a4d0cdae7d6aa52d63454a320fbb30c46ed54eed2abeb5b36049929fb35527", "ja": "だからこそ、そういう悲しみを隠して戦う覚悟が\n伝わってきて、すごく凛々しく見えたよ。", "zh": "正因为如此，你隐藏着那份悲伤战斗的觉悟传达了出来，看上去特别英姿飒爽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "c20429b2abb8f44c49af243dc53027e2d0de66811ee7c892cbee907d5858827b", "ja": "そうかい？　えへへ……やっぱし一度、\n似たような経験してるのが、よかったのかねぇ。", "zh": "是吗？嘿嘿……果然还是因为有过一次类似的经历，才会这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "3e6def1fb17be3f8599971f8519e195c8b59b3fff058809fcb2d723793f82577", "ja": "あたしはこの役の提督みたいに、\n友達と戦ったりとかは、したことないけど……。", "zh": "我虽然没有像这个角色的提督一样，和朋友战斗过什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "56494791856d0afa73f68d14e5b08c350e81914a3811a69506d4f3b8c6a05490", "ja": "でも、大事な人とのお別れってのは、\n経験してっから。", "zh": "不过，和重要的人告别这种事，我经历过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9b5552968e8dff0057cb26a408e03f5d30220e9a01c9dee35b1a2f2e4938f10f", "ja": "うん？　あ……それは、北海道を離れたときの？", "zh": "嗯？啊……那是指离开北海道的时候吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "c6aa4ae052ae2cb1bca17a846ac0cd575aba404cc9dc7ebb69e56fb74893bced", "ja": "うん。大好きな家族や友達と別れたときは、\nとっても悲しかったべさ。", "zh": "嗯。和最喜欢的家人还有朋友分开的时候，\n真的好难过啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b86deece80b9eb711a1b9ac016ffe0328a8f0877adc7904b88c1a4813dee6ae7", "ja": "そうだよな……。やっぱり今でも、\n寂しかったりするのか？", "zh": "是啊……果然你现在还是会感到寂寞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "93f3e7a7577581bf377e9d60653a91ab823ba387939fcb11e97383192afd833a", "ja": "ちょっこしね。でも、最近気づいたんだぁ。\n確かに今は、みんなと離れちゃったけども……。", "zh": "是有一点点。不过，我最近发现了。虽然现在确实和大家分开了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "4edf273b35fdd4c47454ab3a6f0a55eb0654e2fd46172857be7d8e3a9e31b941", "ja": "あたしがみんなを思う気持ちは、あのときとちっとも\n変わってないし、みんなもそうだと思うんだぁ。", "zh": "我对大家的心意，和那时候相比一点都没有改变，我想大家也是一样的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "c9f6e4ecbca2619ce89ac2b68b32b800eeab9fe2c2c2a654af5b25041a1efbe2", "ja": "だからきっと、提督さんと海賊さんも、\n同じなんじゃないかなぁって……。", "zh": "所以我想，提督先生和海盗先生应该也是一样的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ef814b2d7f75e230853e0493f34fba470ecde2832e2737d95cba27f6f69ac0af", "ja": "ああ。どんなに遠く離れたとしても、\n互いを思う気持ちは変わらない。俺もそう思うよ。", "zh": "啊。无论相隔多么遥远，思念彼此的心情也不会改变。我也是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "5768cada6c526b4e2603d6ddfadfc7bbcf4d2972f1f605266b27a9fef3c0244e", "ja": "うんっ！　だからね、そんな提督としての\n気持ちを大事にして、本番はもっともっと頑張るよぉ！", "zh": "嗯！所以呢，我会珍惜作为提督的这份心情，在正式演出时更加更加努力哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "a84bc67ee362c47a2c1b1f970ad63835ee66b29999040a591dd4fe4c8388e326", "ja": "したっけ、{$P$}もちゃあんと\n見ててねぇ……傾注っ！　だべさ♪", "zh": "那么，{$P$}也要好好看着哦……注意！对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0244_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4378871f6100e6badbdfaa439704b94d02cf8a084e12777164041664f68c2ec6", "ja": "（提督役、もっと悩ませてしまうかと思って\nいたけど……ぴったりなキャスティングだったな！）", "zh": "（本来还担心提督这个角色会让她更伤脑筋……不过，这个选角真是太合适了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
